{"id": "404306", "name": "פולינום מקלורן מסדר 2 של פונקציה המוגדרת כאינטגרל", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "arccos", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "f", "params": ["t"], "body": "t/((t-C)^2+1)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>חשבו את פולינום מקלורן (טיילור סביב אפס) <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(x)\\)</span> מסדר 2 של הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F(x)=\\int_{ {{CT:0}}}^{x} {{CT:1}}\\,dt \\]</p><p>רשמו את הביטוי המדויק. את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln\\)</span> מקלידים <span dir=\"ltr\">ln</span>, ואת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\arctan\\)</span> מקלידים <span dir=\"ltr\">atan</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(P(x)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> לפי המשפט היסודי, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'(x)=f(x)\\)</span>. מחשבים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F(0)\\)</span>, ‏<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(0)\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'(0)\\)</span> ומציבים בנוסחת פולינום מקלורן.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — נוסחת מקלורן</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ P(x)=F(0)+F'(0)\\,x+\\frac{F''(0)}{2!}x^2 \\]</p>לפי המשפט היסודי של החדו\"א, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'(x)=f(x)\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F''(x)=f'(x)\\)</span>, כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(t)={{CT:1}}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — המקדמים של x ושל x²</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'(0)=f(0)=0\\)</span>. לפי כלל המנה,<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'(t)=\\frac{\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)^2+1-2t\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)}{\\left(\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)^2+1\\right)^2},\\qquad f'(0)=\\frac{ {{CT:3}}}{ {{CT:3}}^2}=\\frac{1}{ {{CT:3}}} \\]</p>ולכן המקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^2\\)</span> הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{f'(0)}{2}={{CT:4}}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — האיבר החופשי F(0)</b><br>מציבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={{CT:2}}\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t={{CT:5}}\\)</span>; הגבולות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t={{CT:0}}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(t=0\\)</span> עוברים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u=0\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={{CT:6}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F(0)=\\int_{ {{CT:0}}}^{0}{{CT:1}}\\,dt=\\int_{0}^{ {{CT:6}}}\\frac{ {{CT:5}}}{u^2+1}\\,du \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ =\\left[{{CT:7}}\\right]_{0}^{ {{CT:6}}}={{CT:8}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 4 — התשובה</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ P(x)={{CT:9}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "log(C^2+1)/2+a2*x^2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>בחישוב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F(0)\\)</span> חסר האיבר עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\arctan\\)</span>: אחרי ההצבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={{CT:2}}\\)</span> המונה הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:5}}\\)</span>, ולא רק <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "a0+x^2/(C^2+1)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p>המקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^2\\)</span> הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{F''(0)}{2!}\\)</span>: שכחתם לחלק ב-2.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "log(C^2+1)/2+C*atan(C)+a2*x^2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<p>בדקו את הסימן של האיבר עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\arctan\\)</span>: הגבול העליון אחרי ההצבה הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={{CT:6}}\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["C", "F0u", "a0", "a2", "tans1"], "nvariants": 20}